======================================================================
BLACKJACK - OFFICIAL RULES & HOW TO PLAY
======================================================================

1. OBJECTIVE/HOW TO WIN
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Beat the dealer by getting a hand value as close to 21 as possible 
without going over (busting). You are playing only against the dealer, 
not other players.

Example winning scenario:

You have a hand of 20 (two face cards; Jack of Spades and Queen of 
Clubs), and the dealer has a hand of 18 (10 of Diamonds and 8 of 
Hearts).

2. CARD VALUES
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Card              | Value
------------------|---------------------------------------------------
2 through 10      | Point value of card (e.g., 7 of Hearts is worth 7)
Jack, Queen, King | 10 points each
Ace               | 1 or 11 points (whichever helps your hand most)


3. HOW TO PLAY (GAME FLOW)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
Step 1: Place your bet before cards are dealt.
Step 2: You and the dealer each receive 2 cards. The dealer gets one 
        facing up (upcard), and another facing down (hole card), while
        you get two upcards.
Step 3: Choose your move:

  Hit         - Take another card. You can hit as many times as 
                    you like until you stand or bust.
  Stand       - Keep your current total and end your turn.

Step 4: Once you stand, the dealer reveals their hole card. The 
        dealer MUST hit on 16 or less and stand on 17 or more.


4. WINNING & PAYOUTS
----------------------------------------------------------------------
* Blackjack (Ace + 10-value card on first 2 cards) : Pays 3 to 2
* Standard Win (Higher total than dealer <= 21)    : Pays 1 to 1
* Dealer Busts (Dealer goes over 21)               : Pays 1 to 1
* Push (Tie with dealer)                           : Bet returned
* Bust (Your total goes over 21)                   : Lose bet
